              <description>
              sdm value update rate.
              update every 16*(update_cycle+1) sdm clock cycle
              </description>
              <bitOffset>21</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>3</bitWidth>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>VAL_SHIFT</name>
              <description>
              dithering value shift value. sdm value is u5.20 format. dithering value is s1.15 format, and ranges from -1 to 1. val_shift refers to the right shift bit of dithering value. val_shift = 1 means dithering value is right shifted by 1bit, which ranges from -0.5 to 0.5
              </description>
              <bitOffset>16</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>5</bitWidth>
            </field>
