              Common value: 8, 13,14, 16, 18, 20, 22, 24.
              for I2S/Left Justified/Right Kistified timing, bb_pcm_dw >=16
              For PCM timing, only 8, 13, 14, 16 configure value is available.
              </description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>5</bitWidth>
            </field>
          </fields>
