              Auto-reload value
              ARR is the value to be loaded in the actual auto-reload register.
              ARR can be used to adjust brightness of breath light. Larger ARR leads to lower brightness.
              </description>
              <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>16</bitWidth>
            </field>
          </fields>
        </register>
        <register>
